[THINKING]● Thinking: **Summarizing code changes and tests results**

I’m putting together a detailed summary of the tenant-aware storefront updates: locale cookie handling, fallback caching, theming cache events, template tweaks, and test coverage. I’ll include key file names and line numbers for clarity, plus testing outcomes—successful module tests and known `node` test failures. This will comprehensively cover the modifications and verification steps.
[RUNNING]● Message: Implemented tenant-aware storefront shell updates covering locale persistence, sample data fallbacks, and theme cache invalidation so the Qute pages render reliably per tenant.

- Baked a locale resolution pipeline that now respects `lang`, a `visitor_locale` cookie, and `Accept-Language`, stores the preference as both a cookie and a `RoutingContext` attribute, and wraps every page method in `Response` helpers so cookies/`Content-Language` headers are emitted consistently (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/StorefrontResource.java:83-1113`). Added cached featured-product fallbacks, sample root categories, and rating-scale helpers so empty tenants still render hero/category/grid sections without errors, and wired the templates to consume the new data (`StorefrontResource.java:299-420`, `components/product-card.html:65-78`, `components/hero.html:1`).
- Introduced the `TenantThemeUpdated` CDI event plus cache-aware observer so theme tokens reload on demand (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/events/TenantThemeUpdated.java:1-22`, `services/ThemeProvider.java:15-185`), and extended `ThemeProviderTest` with cache invalidation coverage (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/ThemeProviderTest.java:180-247`).
- Seeded real tenants/custom domains inside `StorefrontRenderingTest`, added tests for locale cookies, tenant-specific branding, and 404 handling, and pushed the hero template to expose an explicit `id` to satisfy the accessibility checks (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/StorefrontRenderingTest.java:36-155`, `templates/components/hero.html:1`).
- Marked task `I2.T3` complete in `.codemachine/artifacts/tasks/tasks_I2.json`.

Testing:
- `./mvnw -pl modules/core-platform -Dtest=ThemeProviderTest,StorefrontRenderingTest test`
- `node tools/test.cjs` (fails because of long-standing suites such as `TenantFilterTest.testInvalidDomainFormats_ReturnsNotFound`, `InventoryTransferIT`, `StripeIntegrationTest`, etc.; no new regressions observed)
